--config	path to treerig.toml (default: nearest above cwd)
--version	output the version number
--file	pin this treerig binary instead of downloading a release; needs --sha256 and --release
--help	help for pin
--latest	download the newest release that is not a pre-release
--release	the release to download and verify, such as 1.2.3 or 0.1.0-rc.1 (no leading v); with --file, a label for the pin instead
--sha256	with --file: the sha256 of that file itself, from a source you trust
--yes	skip the confirmation phrase
:4
